  "$comment": [
    "THE WORLD PLACEMENT FILE — every placed thing on the island.",
    "The scene builds from this; blockers regenerate from it.",
    "",
    "Edit by hand, or open the world with ?editor (dev only), move",
    "things with the mouse, and press Copy/Write placements.",
    "",
    "lat: 90 = the pole (spawn). grass ends ~66, sand runs 24 down to",
    "     the waterline ~15. long: 0 = sunset side, 180 = night side.",
    "yawDeg: 0 faces local NORTH (uphill); positive turns east.",
    "scale: 1 = as authored. blockerRadiusM: omit for no collision.",
    "liftM: extra height (things on furniture, or the floating rift).",
    "",
    "ALTITUDE IS NEVER STORED: every placement sits at",
    "groundAltitudeAt(lat, long) - SINK_M + (liftM ?? 0)."
